">About The Invite</h2><div  id=\"block-51161\" class=\"o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-1\" data-block='[]'><h2>It'll be fun.</h2><p>Joe (<strong>Seth Rogan</strong>) and Angela’s (<strong>Olivia Wilde</strong>) marriage is on thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbour's (<strong>Edward Norton</strong>, <strong>Penélope Cruz</strong>) for a dinner party, the night spirals into unexpected places.</p></div><div  id=\"block-51162\" class=\"o-block o-grid__item \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-2\" data-block='[\"text\"]'><div class=\"c-embed\" style=\"--aspect-ratio: 1.77;\"><v-embed\n\t\t\t\tembed-code=\"&quot;&lt;div class=\\&quot;fetch  fetch--youtube\\&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe title=\\&quot;youtube embed\\&quot;  width=\\&quot;200\\&quot; height=\\&quot;113\\&quot; src=\\&quot;https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/OJ19I9q_hOQ?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=transparent\\&quot; frameborder=\\&quot;0\\&quot; allow=\\&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\&quot; referrerpolicy=\\&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\&quot; allowfullscreen title=\\&quot;The Invite | Official Trailer HD | A24\\&quot; &gt;&lt;\\/iframe&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;&quot;\"\n\t\t\t\t:required-cookie-categories=\"[]\"></v-embed></div></div><div  id=\"block-51163\" class=\"o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-3\" data-block='[\"embed\"]'><p>This film is distributed by <a href=\"https://blackbearpictures.com/\"><strong>Black Bear Pictures</strong></a>.</p></div></section></div><aside class=\"o-sidebar-grid__sidebar \" id=\"page-sidebar\"><div class=\"c-meta o-block\"><h2 class=\"c-meta__heading\">Details</h2><dl class=\"c-meta__list\"><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Certificate</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">15</dd></div><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Duration</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">107 minutes</dd></div><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Director</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">Olivia Wilde</dd></div><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Venue</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">SCREEN 2</dd></div></dl></div><section ><div id=\"\" class=\"c-banner c-banner--featured c-banner--small h-theme--white\" data-sc-gtm-category=\"Banner\" data-sc-gtm-label=\"Accessibility\" data-sc-gtm-value=\"\"><h2 class=\"c-banner__title\">Accessibility</h2><div class=\"c-banner__text\"><p>If you have any access requirements, please contact our box office team on<strong> 020 7613 7498 </strong>or email <a href=\"mailto:boxoffice@richmix.org.uk\">boxoffice@richmix.org.uk.</a></p><p><a href=\"https://richmix.org.uk/visit-us/access\">Find all accessibility info for Rich Mix</a>.</p></div></div></section><section ><h3 class=\"h-accessibility\">Upsells</h3><ul class=\"o-list\"><li class=\"o-list__item o-grid__item\"><a id=\"\" class=\"c-banner c-banner--deco-two c-banner--featured c-banner--small h-theme--red\" href=\"https://richmix-prod.servd.supercooldesign.dev/membership\" data-sc-gtm-category=\"Banner\" data-sc-gtm-label=\"Rich Mix members enjoy...\" data-sc-gtm-value=\"\"><h2 class=\"c-banner__title\">Rich Mix members enjoy...</h2><div class=\"c-banner__text\"><p>Free tickets on joining &amp; discounted tickets on every visit – plus, no booking fees. </p></div><div class=\"c-banner__action o-button o-button--regular\">Find out more</div><div class=\"c-banner__image\"><div class=\"o-image\"><img class=\"o-image__img\" src=\"https://rich-mix.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Cinema/Audience-pic.png?w=540&amp;h=360&amp;q=100&amp;auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;dm=1781531316&amp;s=18084a2fbd9fbcaaf454ab52aec2f837\" width=\"540\" height=\"360\" alt=\"A gr