s=\"c-page-header__subheading\">Tomorrow's showtimes</h3><ul class=\"c-page-header__secondary-actions\"><li><a href=\"/book/instance/1910008\" class=\"o-button o-button--small o-button--featured\">3:50pm</a></li><li><a href=\"/book/instance/1910009\" class=\"o-button o-button--small o-button--featured\">6:15pm</a></li><li><a href=\"/book/instance/1910010\" class=\"o-button o-button--small o-button--featured\">8:45pm</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"c-page-header__action\"><event-manager\n      type=\"event\"\n      :instance-data=\"{&quot;instanceId&quot;:50971,&quot;instanceUrlId&quot;:&quot;1910022&quot;,&quot;stopSellingDate&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\"\n      :event-data=\"{&quot;eventName&quot;:&quot;Obsession&quot;,&quot;eventId&quot;:41475,&quot;numberOfInstances&quot;:15,&quot;allowFacilitatedBooking&quot;:false}\"\n      :import-data=\"{&quot;importId&quot;:&quot;1910022ARPBTCDDRLQLRPGSNMHLTDQSGT&quot;,&quot;importUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/tickets.richmix.org.uk\\/richmix&quot;}\"\n      :availability-data=\"{&quot;availabilityOverride&quot;:&quot;syncValue&quot;}\"\n      :button-data=\"{&quot;buttonPreset&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;buttonTextOverride&quot;:null,&quot;buttonStateOverride&quot;:{&quot;label&quot;:&quot;Sync value&quot;,&quot;value&quot;:&quot;useSyncValue&quot;,&quot;selected&quot;:true,&quot;valid&quot;:true,&quot;icon&quot;:null,&quot;color&quot;:null},&quot;buttonHrefOverride&quot;:null,&quot;buttonDefaultText&quot;:&quot;Other dates and times&quot;,&quot;buttonDefaultUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/richmix.org.uk\\/cinema\\/obsession-18#dates-and-times&quot;}\"\n      class=\"\"\n    ><template v-slot:default=\"{dataReady,availability,eligibility,buttonData,onSale,numberOfInstances}\"><em-button class=\"\" :numberOfInstances=\"numberOfInstances\" :data-ready=\"dataReady\" :availability=\"availability\" :eligibility=\"eligibility\" :overrides=\"buttonData\" v-if=\"onSale\"></em-button></template></event-manager></div></div></div></header></div><div class=\"o-sidebar-grid__container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t o-grid o-grid--flush\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid=\"page-container\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t><div class=\"o-sidebar-grid__menu\" id=\"page-menu\"></div><aside class=\"o-sidebar-grid__sidebar \"></aside><div class=\"o-sidebar-grid__content\" id=\"page-content\"><section class=\"o-grid\"><h2 class=\"h-accessibility\">About Obsession</h2><div  id=\"block-44273\" class=\"o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-1\" data-block='[]'><h2>Be careful who you wish for…</h2><p>After breaking the mysterious “One Wish Willow” to win his crush’s heart, a hopeless romantic finds himself getting exactly what he asked for but soon discovers that some desires come at a dark, sinister price.</p></div><div  id=\"block-46836\" class=\"o-block o-grid__item \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-2\" data-block='[\"text\"]'><div class=\"c-embed\" style=\"--aspect-ratio: 1.77;\"><v-embed\n\t\t\t\tembed-code=\"&quot;&lt;div class=\\&quot;fetch  fetch--youtube\\&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe title=\\&quot;youtube embed\\&quot;  width=\\&quot;200\\&quot; height=\\&quot;113\\&quot; src=\\&quot;https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/gMC8kkwbIQQ?feature=oembed&amp;wmode=transparent\\&quot; frameborder=\\&quot;0\\&quot; allow=\\&quot;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\&quot; referrerpolicy=\\&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\&quot; allowfullscreen title=\\&quot;Obsession | Official Trailer\\&quot; &gt;&lt;\\/iframe&gt;&lt;\\/div&gt;&quot;\"\n\t\t\t\t:required-cookie-categories=\"[]\"></v-embed></div></div><div  id=\"block-44274\" class=\"o-block o-grid__item o-grid__item--force-space \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-3\" data-block='[\"embed\"]'><blockquote class=\"c-quote\"><div class=\"c-quote__star-rating\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 out of 5 stars\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g clip-path=\"url(#a)\"><path d=\"m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z\"/></g><defs><clipPath id=\"a\"><path d=\"M0 0h70v70H0z\"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g clip-path=\"url(#a)\"><path d=\"m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z\"/></g><defs><clipPath id=\"a\"><path d=\"M0 0h70v70H0z\"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g clip-path=\"url(#a)\"><path d=\"m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z\"/></g><defs><clipPath id=\"a\"><path d=\"M0 0h70v70H0z\"/></clipPath></defs></svg><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 70 70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g clip-path=\"url(#a)\"><path d=\"m35 2 8.082 24.875h26.156L48.078 42.25l8.082 24.876L35 51.75 13.84 67.125l8.082-24.876L.762 26.875h26.155L35 2Z\"/></g><defs><clipPath id=\"a\"><path d=\"M0 0h70v70H0z\"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><p class=\"c-quote__text\">Frighteningly effective.</p><footer class=\"c-quote__cite\"><cite><p>The Guardian</p></cite></footer></blockquote></div><div  id=\"block-46837\" class=\"o-block o-text o-text-block o-grid__item \t\n\t\t\th-colstart--1 h-colend--9 h-phone-colstart--1 h-phone-colend--13 has-h-col\n\t o-block--row-4\" data-block='[\"quote\"]'><p>This film is distributed by <a href=\"https://www.universalpictures.co.uk/\"><strong>Universal Pictures.</strong></a></p></div></section></div><aside class=\"o-sidebar-grid__sidebar \" id=\"page-sidebar\"><div class=\"c-meta o-block\"><h2 class=\"c-meta__heading\">Details</h2><dl class=\"c-meta__list\"><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Certificate</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">18</dd></div><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Duration</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">109 minutes</dd></div><div class=\"c-meta__item\"><dt class=\"c-meta__key\">Director</dt><dd class=\"c-meta__value\">Curry Barker</dd></div></dl></div><section ><div id=\"\" class=\"c-banner c-banner--featured c-banner--small h-theme--white\" data-sc-gtm-category=\"Banner\" data-sc-gtm-label=\"Accessibility\" data-sc-gtm-value=\"\"><h2 class=\"c-banner__title\">Accessibility</h2><div class=\"c-banner__text\"><p>If you have any access requirements, please contact our box office team on<strong> 020 7613 7498 </strong>or email <a href=\"mailto:boxoffice@richmix.org.uk\">boxoffice@richmix.org.uk.</a></p><p><a href=\"https://richmix.org.uk/visit-us/access\">Find all accessibility info for Rich Mix</a>.</p></div></div></section><section ><h3 class=\"h-accessibility\">Upsells</h3><ul class=\"o-list\"><li class=\"o-list__item o-grid__item\"><a id=\"\" class=\"c-banner c-banner--deco-two c-banner--featured c-banner--small h-theme--red\" href=\"https://richmix-prod.servd.supercooldesign.dev/membership\" data-sc-gtm-category=\"Banner\" data-sc-gtm-label=\"Rich Mix members enjoy...\" data-sc-gtm-value=\"\"><h2 class=\"c-banner__title\">Rich Mix members enjoy...</h2><div class=\"c-banner__text\"><p>Free tickets on joining &amp; discounted tickets on every visit – plus, no booking fees. </p></div><div class=\"c-banner__action o-button o-button--regular\">Find out more</div><div class=\"c-banner__image\"><div class=\"o-image\"><img class=\"o-image__img\" src=\"https://rich-mix.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Cinema/Audienc