ion\": \"\nA brand new day starts now.Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker (Tom Holland) he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\n        \"location\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Place\",\n          \"name\": \"Rich Mix\",\n          \n\n\n\n        }\n      }\n    </script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@type\": \"Event\",\n        \"name\": \"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\n        \"startDate\": \"2026-07-29T17:20:00+01:00\",\n        \"image\": [\"https://rich-mix.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Cinema/spider-man-brand-new-day.jpeg?w=1200&h=600&q=100&auto=format&fit=crop&dm=1782143977&s=80b0c7fe2616a7462bfb70a4ee3ce539\",\"https://rich-mix.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Cinema/spider-man-brand-new-day.jpeg?w=800&h=600&q=100&auto=format&fit=crop&dm=1782143977&s=88df57ba9647be32fcbed26638db3e24\",\"https://rich-mix.transforms.svdcdn.com/production/Cinema/spider-man-brand-new-day.jpeg?w=600&h=600&q=100&auto=format&fit=crop&dm=1782143977&s=2529d397b8fed291804ab77fd128ba76\"],\n        \"description\": \"\nA brand new day starts now.Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn’t remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker (Tom Holland) he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\n        \"location\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Place\",\n          \"name\": \"Rich Mix\",\n          \n\n\n\n        }\n      }\n    </script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\n