ema/v9ctdxgus3yk0r6s9hfi9m83zk9k-copy-2.jpg?w=600&h=600&q=100&auto=format&fit=crop&dm=1782743963&s=5ba0b8ab0fb387a6cca205a309ba2a9b\"],\n        \"description\": \"\nA 90 minute live show, with award-winning writer and podcaster Simon Brew. Film Stories Live is a lively, entertaining celebration of the movies. And in 2026, it’s going on tour! Each show is a nerdy dive into cinema, with plenty of laughs, lots of geeking out, and a bunch of stories about the movies. Plus: filmmaking guests, and terrible money-can-buy prizes at the end. Each show will also be filmed and recorded, too.Simon Brew Instagram\",\n        \"location\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Place\",\n          \"name\": \"Rich Mix\",\n          \n\n\n\n        }\n      }\n    </script><!-- dev only edit buttons --></body></html>\n",
